  "description": "htop, as a dashboard: the header line, per-core CPU meters, memory and swap meters, and the process list. Only hosts with alloy_enable_process=true appear in the picker, since the process exporter is opt-in; the host list is driven by the process metrics themselves so it cannot offer a host with no data.",
